   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 3 - Reference modification (edit an image with references)\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va diffusion model, Qwen3-VL text encoder, video VAE (no audio).\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: the image to edit, an edit instruction, up to 8 more reference images.\n\n**Controls**: quality_profile = how many frames H3 renders for one still (more = slower, steadier); source_fidelity = how strongly the source is held; the frame selector picks the best frame.\n\n**Output**: one PNG in output/h3_tasks/.\n\n**Limits**: an image model run as a short video: one frame is kept; very large edits drift from the source.\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# 3 - Reference modification (edit an image with references)\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va diffusion model, Qwen3-VL text encoder, video VAE (no audio).\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: the image to edit, an edit instruction, up to 8 more reference images.\n\n**Controls**: quality_profile = how many frames H3 renders for one still (more = slower, steadier); source_fidelity = how strongly the source is held; the frame selector picks the best frame.\n\n**Output**: one PNG in output/h3_tasks/.\n\n**Limits**: an image model run as a short video: one frame is kept; very large edits drift from the source.\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
